[{"title":"再送秋岑","author":"戴亨","text":"杯酒送君行，秋风落叶声。\n同悲衰老日，可奈别离情。\n孤屿扁舟夜，荒江古月明。\n遥思悽绝处，噭噭听猿鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10426,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三题松乔小室","author":"戴亨","text":"小室藏幽邃，公馀足自娱。\n纵横四五步，花竹两三株。\n长日鸦反哺，晴檐燕引雏。\n家庭饶至乐，岂必羡华膴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10427,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"四题小室","author":"戴亨","text":"入世仍尘迹，公归即散襟。\n移花邀月近，款竹闭门深。\n鱼亦濠梁乐，云留谷口阴。\n此中真味永，得意托微吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10428,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"北牖","author":"戴亨","text":"南荣思曝背，北牖苦寒侵。\n风透成冰室，云留酿雪阴。\n客心增岁暮，老貌觉愁深。\n逸调弹隆古，寥寥孰赏音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10429,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"往晤云浦留饮竟日","author":"戴亨","text":"龙塞萦遥思，蜗庐减壮裁。\n寂寥残腊候，冰雪故人来。\n辽海倾诗橐，燕山共酒杯。\n更看周急意，襟抱对君开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10430,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得岁寒松","author":"戴亨","text":"万物凋零日，青苍见尔辰。\n虽能甘苦节，非不愿阳春。\n岂羡知稀贵，偏于岁暮亲。\n四时无改序，淹寂亦何瞋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10431,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"戴亨","text":"惨淡谋尊酒，妻孥坐夜阑。\n岁从明日改，腊尽片时欢。\n艰苦年来惯，身心老渐安。\n敢同颜子乐，颇识送穷难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10432,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元日","author":"戴亨","text":"一从辞宦籍，五载客长安。\n湖海难酬愿，风尘且驻颜。\n繁华新物态，诗酒自人间。\n来往从纷剧，衡门镇日关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10433,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客斋见月","author":"戴亨","text":"出世心如昨，羁尘迹尚初。\n深宵闻远笛，孤月照荒庐。\n诗句随年老，交情隔势疏。\n茫茫天宇下，何处卜吾居。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10434,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仲夏过明复庵别业","author":"戴亨","text":"仲夏苦炎热，幽栖出郭寻。\n淹君高树荫，清我远尘襟。\n山鸟偶然下，谷云时作阴。\n对兹真作乐，聊可傲华簪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10435,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"昼夜无停运，乾坤自混濛。\n万殊陶大化，一物杂昆虫。\n甘苦缘生命，荣枯各始终。\n无端秋又至，萧飒下天风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10436,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"索居多物感，孤坐易情伤。\n白露几时下，西风昨夜狂。\n雁归知塞苦，人老觉秋忙。\n回首思年少，悤悤两鬓霜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10437,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋 其三","author":"戴亨","text":"白帝司秋令，当之草木棼。\n但知成委折，那复辨莸薰。\n霜杵敲寒月，边鸿叫夜云。\n商声无远近，孤客不堪闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10438,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋 其四","author":"戴亨","text":"觉后原吾任，逡巡未尽迂。\n风尘无巨识，今古薄真儒。\n作客非长计，依人岂壮夫。\n云中瞻白鹤，翘翮笑樊笯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10439,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋 其五","author":"戴亨","text":"浊秽方从俗，幽深岂自如。\n烟霞思海屋，风雨恋蜗庐。\n遐契何能遂，尘情未易除。\n去留难自主，搔首问晴虚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10440,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋 其六","author":"戴亨","text":"百龄浑易尽，垂白尚浮踪。\n老树延孤鹤，阴丛集乱蛩。\n一灯寒夜雨，双鬓暮秋容。\n惓惓终何益，名山有桂松。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10441,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠年家子戈编修芥舟李编修廉衣","author":"戴亨","text":"宇宙谁同调，风尘岁月惊。\n斯文逢二子，吾道不孤鸣。\n旦夕庸人计，千秋志士情。\n问年均可畏，头白感商声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10442,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后偶成","author":"戴亨","text":"庭前新雨歇，把卷思无端。\n明月露松隙，草虫鸣夜阑。\n诗文随我贱，肝胆向人寒。\n薄劣从浮世，幽偏觅古欢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10443,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"简明复庵","author":"戴亨","text":"烟海茫茫世，卑栖但浊尘。\n交游四十载，寒士两三人。\n每爱石林静，兼怀襟抱真。\n携筇频出郭，沽酒莫辞贫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10444,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"负游","author":"戴亨","text":"空斋增抑郁，游约负前盟。\n幽梦灵崖结，孤怀俗务婴。\n苍山悬暮雨，黄叶下秋声。\n谁识残年里，殷殷世外情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10445,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送孟颖仙任东平州佐四首 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"两世金兰旧，千秋德义新。\n白头将共老，童稚早情亲。\n崇替经交态，初终见古人。\n别离分显晦，邂逅复谁真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10446,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送孟颖仙任东平州佐四首 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"学业谁堪并，迍邅可若何。\n济东新雨露，燕市旧悲歌。\n知己情难别，期君意倍苛。\n为贫聊试仕，远抱莫蹉跎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10447,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送孟颖仙任东平州佐四首 其三","author":"戴亨","text":"著书期寿国，夙愿未全非。\n旧俗东平厚，今春麦秀肥。\n题舆勷牧治，捧檄出皇畿。\n学道思言偃，牛刀用岂违。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10448,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送孟颖仙任东平州佐四首 其四","author":"戴亨","text":"雄飞传赵鼎，佐岳起陈蕃。\n脱颖锥初试，冲霄剑欲抡。\n济云连粉署，岱色覆琴尊。\n政暇饶佳制，因风寄荜门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10449,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赠平主事弼侯新居 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"官授小司空，君曾远戍戎。\n野狐秋拜月，塞马夜嘶风。\n旧历边庭险，新营竹石工。\n巾车期不忘，此意亦何穷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10450,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赠平主事弼侯新居 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"何人勤在昔，留此待君娱。\n林壑气相结，冈峦势不孤。\n苔生新履迹，庭敞卧游图。\n心远齐喧寂，朝昏乐故吾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10451,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赠平主事弼侯新居 其三","author":"戴亨","text":"退食耽清课，幽人乐在斯。\n随花閒甃石，就水暗通池。\n邀客舒吟啸，呼童具酒卮。\n一从叨末座，留恋意长驰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10452,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赠平主事弼侯新居 其四","author":"戴亨","text":"遥识炎天爽，幽居惬素襟。\n藤萝经暑薄，松竹受阴深。\n就榻宜高枕，登台豁远岑。\n凭兹离俗意，堪證出尘心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10453,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题赠平主事弼侯新居 其五","author":"戴亨","text":"连朝愁酷热，台榭拟攀跻。\n瓜果消炎日，诗文寄赫蹄。\n长林麋鹿性，丰草野禽栖。\n乘兴探幽邃，应教出处迷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10454,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"连日苦热因忆明复庵别业 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"朱明增酷烈，离垢想清芬。\n槐荫留长日，山房接断云。\n园蔬经雨摘，村酒隔篱分。\n风味宛如昨，孤吟怅夕曛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10455,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"连日苦热因忆明复庵别业 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"僻处违城市，相求独往还。\n人嫌茅屋漏，我爱竹林閒。\n草色荒行径，松阴覆掩关。\n徘徊时北望，云树隔颓颜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10456,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷溪晚步偕诸同人","author":"戴亨","text":"缓步循溪岸，探荷涤暑氛。\n风轻鸥梦觉，水净月痕分。\n佛火明僧梵，箫声隔浦云。\n冠童人五六，归咏自成群。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10457,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷溪夜步用前韵","author":"戴亨","text":"荷香邀客兴，柳岸净尘氛。\n明月照沙际，披襟坐夜分。\n身閒宽杖履，头白眷烟云。\n凫雁情何逸，将随尔作群。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10458,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷溪","author":"戴亨","text":"终年长作客，何处可娱情。\n贪看桥西水，时为饭后行。\n湖光生静绪，山色召幽盟。\n科跣无相识，孤吟每月明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10459,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷溪独往","author":"戴亨","text":"咫尺桥西路，香风动芰荷。\n罢餐长散步，无伴亦相过。\n逸兴亲鱼棹，閒心羡雨蓑。\n新诗吟欲就，隐隐起菱歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10460,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷溪偕门人昭信","author":"戴亨","text":"湖上风光好，千回不厌劳。\n天连平水阔，山接暮云高。\n牢落从时辈，逍遥付我曹。\n尔能随杖履，解此亦人豪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10461,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷溪独往","author":"戴亨","text":"最可披襟处，纷趋但市寰。\n人情殊好尚，吾道合湖山。\n鱼鸟若为侣，烟霞相与閒。\n月明群籁静，踽踽踏沙还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10462,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋前荷溪","author":"戴亨","text":"书斋西数武，别有远尘天。\n芒履偶然到，沧洲久自专。\n藤萝垂暮雨，桑柘起疏烟。\n景色新秋近，轻凉亦可怜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10463,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷溪偕庆祠部松乔","author":"戴亨","text":"未遂岩栖志，聊寻逆旅欢。\n看云思郑谷，临水忆湘兰。\n尘市形骸局，湖山天地宽。\n此情君若达，应不恋閒官。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10464,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷溪示诸生","author":"戴亨","text":"百年唯适意，富贵欲何如。\n直道人情远，迂儒世务疏。\n溪山留造化，天地饷樵渔。\n尔辈成名后，应思早遂初。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10465,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和白鹤亭送无凡上人结茅盘山原韵 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"振锡超尘境，飘然远绝群。\n松门衔峭壁，石榻沤寒云。\n一法心无住，千江月不分。\n遥知莲社侣，携笑虎溪闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10466,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和白鹤亭送无凡上人结茅盘山原韵 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"性空虽不昧，尘海亦徒然。\n撒手名山去，归心古佛前。\n岭猿清妙悟，松月静安禅。\n回首泥涂界，人天隔幻烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10467,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"前题再叠原韵 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"此去成长往，甘心草木群。\n移花秋贮月，种石夜留云。\n禅室钟鱼静，斋粮鸟雀分。\n山窗空际雨，应向定中闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10468,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"前题再叠原韵 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"结茅空翠辟，烛径野花然。\n樵路侵厨过，峰峦赴榻前。\n澄潭空众象，秋月照枯禅。\n时有探奇兴，携筇涧底烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10469,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"前题三叠原韵 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"田盘高莫极，清冷出人群。\n霄汉长悬月，虚空不住云。\n钟鸣山谷应，竹引石泉分。\n红叶萧萧落，秋声静里闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10470,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"前题三叠原韵 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"谁识根尘净，今能得自然。\n鸟啼山月上，门掩谷云前。\n漉酒閒中课，敲诗醉后禅。\n远公高卧处，翘首但苍烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10471,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜怀台湾六巡察居鲁","author":"戴亨","text":"嘹唳雁声高，秋空月丽霄。\n孤斋亲浊酒，万里隔寒宵。\n滩雨蛮烟路，星槎海国潮。\n故人官绝域，书札望迢遥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10472,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送云浦出塞觐亲 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"每至黄花节，频伤出塞軿。\n况当新抱恨，不比旧趋庭。\n桐杖扶边月，风林惨客星。\n乳鸦哀苦韵，忍畏老亲听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10473,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送云浦出塞觐亲 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"晓起严征橐，霜花入望纷。\n马头升旭日，鸿背落寒云。\n海气深秋肃，笳声绝塞闻。\n旅怀当此际，一倍感离群。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10474,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送云浦出塞觐亲 其三","author":"戴亨","text":"贪程悲不觉，游子暮何依。\n落日孤烟远，辽天古木稀。\n长途趋色养，回首念慈帏。\n霜露情悽怆，中宵泪满衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10475,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送云浦出塞觐亲 其四","author":"戴亨","text":"居邻辽水岸，牧野旧非田。\n骄马嘶风烧，奔狼骇猎烟。\n君经沙漠地，我忆雪霜天。\n羁旅怜同调，空斋计日还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10476,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻警 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"九重敷德化，万国凛王章。\n致乱伊谁咎，安危庙算长。\n舆图全盛日，宵小敢跳梁。\n应瘽如伤虑，哀矜慰善良。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10477,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻警 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"晋阳边寨接，仓卒报烟尘。\n拥节虚名将，宣威遣大臣。\n饥寒趋险步，盗贼本良民。\n四境期宁谧，嘉谟在抚循。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10478,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其一","author":"戴亨","text":"一身随化转，万感逼秋来。\n老骨风霜练，残年日月摧。\n寒生边地苦，愁结暮笳哀。\n岂有超尘识，雄心却早灰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10479,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其二","author":"戴亨","text":"精华疲出处，岁月缚饔飧。\n售世才无用，传经道不尊。\n云心盟海鹤，风翮变神鲲。\n近得吴山逸，相期隐鹿门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10480,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其三","author":"戴亨","text":"碌碌成何事，纷纷困浊泥。\n人情同画虎，吾道类醯鸡。\n不识青云路，终当皓首迷。\n烟霞泉石外，信有好楼栖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10481,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其四","author":"戴亨","text":"婆心堪自信，苦口事全殊。\n已历人情久，方知吾道孤。\n发蒙无厚力，立雪有前儒。\n抱瑟归蓬户，齐门耻滥竽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10482,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其五","author":"戴亨","text":"力学何终极，耄年志不昏。\n寸心争日月，斗室贮乾坤。\n春雨浓花径，秋霜老树村。\n寄情荣悴外，得意向谁论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10483,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其六","author":"戴亨","text":"久稔人情幻，频增景物愁。\n霜蛩寒叫月，风萚夜鸣秋。\n海岳思平庆，云山忆点求。\n和光宜用晦，终觉此心不。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10484,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其七","author":"戴亨","text":"西峰萦叆叇，翘首望连延。\n红叶空山雨，青槐古寺烟。\n林泉谁作主，登眺我无缘。\n咫尺违佳赏，遐心一倍悬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10485,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其八","author":"戴亨","text":"乾坤操大运，今古递相推。\n庸碌欢娱日，英贤恐惧时。\n披书堪自鉴，处世畏人知。\n囊括期无咎，将随木石居。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10486,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其九","author":"戴亨","text":"闻说畿东路，阳侯肆虐豪。\n三齐成巨浸，万姓委洪涛。\n调燮资华衮，流离恻缊袍。\n銮舆将远幸，恩泽慰呼号。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10487,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其十","author":"戴亨","text":"岂乐羁尘世，中怀愿莫酬。\n两棺贫未举，八口计难周。\n慈孝非能尽，神仙不可求。\n敢言乘六气，无待与天游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10488,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其十一","author":"戴亨","text":"诗书千载业，辛苦百年身。\n嗜古甘违俗，为儒不厌贫。\n青箱承世泽，白首付何人。\n展卷然疑作，空闻有德邻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10489,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其十二","author":"戴亨","text":"百岁难辞累，悽然念此生。\n飘零亲属计，孤寡远乡情。\n黄卷终何用，丹沙未易成。\n雪霜盈鬓发，皎皎镜中明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10490,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其十三","author":"戴亨","text":"举世谁知己，深秋倍郁陶。\n风霜摧劲节，兰蕙悴盲飙。\n大业愁担荷，名山正寂寥。\n抗怀期尚友，乐道有箪瓢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10491,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其十四","author":"戴亨","text":"才过黄花节，萧条满目伤。\n山川囚苦月，天地梏严霜。\n皋比愁空坐，文章气不扬。\n扶筇时出户，风色望苍苍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10492,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其十五","author":"戴亨","text":"蘋藻襄公事，知谁是女宗。\n妍媸无定态，进退欲何从。\n弃妇多贞操，新妆但丽容。\n不忘葑菲咏，旨蓄御严冬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10493,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其十六","author":"戴亨","text":"才华矜敏捷，裘马斗缤纷。\n陇水原无定，初流势已分。\n苦心乖世好，老貌杂人群。\n自顾形骸秽，身藏岂用文。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10494,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋怀杂感 其十七","author":"戴亨","text":"眠食安常性，粗疏亦任人。\n事多增旅况，病易入衰辰。\n老骥犹存骨，神鹰耻受驯。\n羁绦何自束，将欲遂天真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":10495,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]